# Only the published screenshots, taken from the app's sample (demo) mailbox, belong here. Any other capture,
# log or test output could show real email or account details, so it's ignored.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
!screenshot.png
!screenshot-dark.png
!screenshot-analytics.png
!screenshot-analytics-dark.png
# The logo (the app's assets/icon/icon-source.png, scaled down).
!logo.png
# The feature pages' pictures, also taken in demo mode (features/*.html).
!features/img/*.png
*.log
*.txt
*.eml
*.msg
